            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Heat from a brine-water heat pump, 50kW with heat source form ice storage and solar tube collector plus energy input from Swiss electricity mix (CH). Lifetime of the heating system is 20 years, ice storage lifetime is 25 years. SPF=5.5. Loss of coolant is 2% (of the total amount in the system) per year. 
UUID: 42644201-a724-3b5a-a71d-3ba6ef9f47aa</common:generalComment>
