        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en"># Included processes\nIncluded are the share of the production of the brine-water heatpump with a lifetime of 20years scaled for 1MJ. Also the ice storage tank and the solar tube collectors as part of the whole system with a lifetime of 25 years is part of this process. \nThe use of electricity (Swiss electriciy mix) is calculated by the SPF = 5.5 for a new building, apartment house.\nAlso the loss of coolant (2% in a year) is included.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
        </technology>
